flowchart TB
  subgraph CLIENTS[User interfaces]
    C[Customer app / Flutter]
    R[Rider app / Flutter]
    P[Merchant POS / Astro + React]
    Y[Pay web / same web application]
  end
  subgraph SERVER[Server authority]
    API[BitPOS API / authenticated commands]
    DOMAIN[Quotes / orders / payment / fulfillment]
    DB[(Postgres / tenant data + command journals)]
    OUT[Durable outbox / persisted events]
    W[Workers / dispatch + reconciliation]
    EVENTS[Scoped realtime / snapshots + SSE]
  end
  ADAPTER[Payment / map / notification adapters]
  MINI[Optional BitPOS Mini integration]
  C --> API
  R --> API
  P --> API
  Y --> API
  API --> DOMAIN
  DOMAIN --> DB
  DB --> OUT
  OUT --> W
  W --> DB
  W --> EVENTS
  API --> EVENTS
  EVENTS --> C
  EVENTS --> R
  EVENTS --> P
  DOMAIN -. configured or fixture boundary .-> ADAPTER
  W -. targeted device events .-> MINI
